WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:07.000
Immunization shows each child's vaccine schedule, and what the centre still needs from you.

2
00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:11.700
What is due lists each vaccine with its dose and due date.

3
00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:16.690
Records you have sent keeps everything you've already given the centre.

4
00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:24.850
To send one in, take a photo of the card or choose a PDF, tick the vaccines it shows if you can, and tap File record.

5
00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:32.650
The centre reviews it and updates your child's schedule. If anything is unclear, they'll message you.
